  - id: 2
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: Pet Name (Kmi)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: No Name
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: What Kmi will refer to the player as
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 3
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: PossiblePhrases
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: 'Mm... Food...|...I suggest you change your diet...|...Every week it''s
        mystery meat...|...Stop feeding babies coloured sugar-coated lard squares...|...Even
        when it''s rotten, we''ve gotten through the hard years|...What up?|...Skippin''
        bail, dippin'' jail, whippin'' tail and sippin'' ale...|...You could either
        ignore this advice or take it from me: Be too nice and people take you for
        a dummy.|...I''m real choosy on what I choose to let crews see...|Never let
        your so-called mans know your plans...|Don''t let it get drastic, think of
        how your moms''ll feel...|...Can''t take the street out the street-person...|...Got
        the only tape that come with a free hot-plate.|...To know enough to give
        them just enough rope to yoke they self...|...Plan B before I take the ring
        and pawn it, the long arm of the law couldn''t even put they fingers on it...|...Once
        they get to know us people dig us...|...Feel ''em like the tinge in your
        ear from drinking ginger beer...|...Train a sane brain to an insane train
        of thought!|...Do you see the perpetrator? Yeah, I''m right here!|...A little
        grease always keeps the wheels a-spinning...|...A lot of stuff happens that
        the news won''t tell you''s...|...Butter softly, leather flossy, fatty juggy...|...They
        told the place not to let the basket type case in... He could be some kind
        of wacko...|...Feel like I''ve been gone over a year, came home to old gear...|...Plead
        the fifth, sip wine stiffly...|...Gift for the grind, criminal mind shifty...|...Swift
        with the nine through a fifty nine fifty...|...Say he stay self medicated
        to sleep later...|Supposed to be checking emails...|...She said it''s free
        and I won''t owe her a penny...|...I wonder what I owe her for a whole box
        of caramel coconut Samoa...|...Fat chance, at least he get snacks...|...That''s
        three different flavors...|...Acting all hard, ''bout to get beat up... I''ll
        show him what time it is once I get this sheet up.|...Even uses a code name:
        Famous Amos...|...And good like 25 cent oatmeal raisin.|Ew! Go wash your
        hands!'
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: DOOM's sick flow
      type: 0
      typeString: 
