  - id: 11
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithKmi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I don't really let that Yally kid drink here anymore. Not after what
        happened last time\u2026|There's a blackjack holo terminal over there if
        you wanna lose some money.|I know you\u2019re new here and everything, but
        you can\u2019t just stand around staring at people all the time... I\u2019ve
        been getting complaints.|Can you go not buy drinks somewhere else?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Kmi (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 12
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithBarry
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "You know about \"deep dish pizza\", friendo? Been thinkin' about trying
        it out... I'm sure I've got some fresh mangoes here somewhere\u2026|What's
        Daniel going on about now?|You space truckin\u2019 types and your vending
        machine snacks\u2026 that stuff will kill you! Try my cornflake salad sometime.|You
        ever try Ionian barbecue? Nothing like it. I tried adding it to the menu
        but I guess you need real magma for the authentic experience\u2026|Did you
        know, my eldest, Xwo, is a lawyer?|I've had my share of complaints, yeah,
        and sure, taste buds *would* help with all the cooking, but who needs taste
        buds when you've got heart? I pour my soul into my cooking and I think people
        can taste that.|Did the catering for a big Oshunian wedding one time. Had
        to wrestle the other chef, right then and there, for the catering rights.
        Gotta love old school Oshunian ceremonies.|I'll tell you something, friendo.
        I set up shop here back when the station was officially a mining complex
        and I haven't even seen half of it. I'm not in a hurry either, the old mines
        creep me out.|Have you checked out McKenna's chakra alignment workshops?
        I try to go once a week myself."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Barry (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 13
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithNammi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I don\u2019t want to be rude, but I don\u2019t do well with unrehearsed
        conversations.|Oh no, I don\u2019t have my human interaction notes handy.|I
        hope Toby\u2019s doing alright.|Have you met Kmi-Pakuru? She looks cool."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Nammi (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 14
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithLrurl
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Hold that thought [var=Pet_Name__Lrurl_&_Klap_], can\u2019t take my
        eyes off this or I risk losing a finger or two.|You ever see a Helicid at
        the rodeo?|Did Klap ever get around to sending you that poem of his?|Word
        of advice, if you ever get the chance to start a business with your spouse,
        do it. Unless they suck at it."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Lrurl (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 15
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithKlap
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Ah, [var=Pet_Name__Lrurl_&_Klap_], a moment please. I mustn\u2019t
        lose my train of thought here.|Say, have you ever had the chance to witness
        a Helicid at the rodeo?|I\u2019d love to hear your thoughts on my limerick
        when you have a moment.|You know, I\u2019ve been alive for 200 years, and
        I\u2019ve spent most of that time pondering the meaning of life. It remains
        as elusive as ever."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Klap (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 16
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithMcKenna
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Greetings and salutations, friend!|May Jubabbi smile upon you, traveler!|Can\u2019t
        wait to set up the juice bar. I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll be a real hit!|Don't
        forget to stretch before you begin, you don't want to sprain anything!|Oh,
        the battle-axe? The Oshunian warrior monks bestowed it upon me when I completed
        my training.|Ask any one of my students, they'll tell you I bend over backwards
        for them! \u2026that's a little yoga joke.|We have sessions set up and lots
        of different workshops throughout the week but you can book a session any
        time, I'm pretty flexible!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with McKenna (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 17
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithGilli
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Wot?|That look on your face\u2026 is that a human thing or is it just
        you?|Don\u2019t underestimate that little Helicid, Yally. They look innocent
        but when they\u2019re off their tiny face, all bets are off.|You know, you
        can go away if you want, mate."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Gilli (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 18
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithShun
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "What?|Can you find somewhere else to be?|\u2026|What is this? We\u2019re
        not friends.|How about you don\u2019t bother me until you deliver my cargo?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Shun (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 19
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: SSwithYally
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Hey, don\u2019t worry if you can\u2019t quite find your bearing around
        here. A lot of the signage on the station is in the modern standardized Helicid
        alphabet, so it might take a while, but you\u2019ll get the hang of it.|You're
        originally from the Sol system, right? Sorry, I didn't want to assume anything,
        it's just that I have a \"Volcano Bucket List\" and the biggest one in your
        entire system is on Mars! Have you ever been?|Have you checked out Lrurl
        & Klapaucius' Workshop yet? Might be a good idea since, you know... you run
        a hangar\u2026 with ships in it. They can fix anything and they throw the
        best dinner parties!|You should come to McKenna's self defense classes every
        Wednesday night! Not sure how, erm, \"culturally sensitive\" that big Oshunian
        battleaxe she carries around is\u2026 Her smoothie game is on point though.|Apparently
        we've got an exobotanist at the station, but he just hangs out at the bar
        most days looking grumpy. I hope he wasn\u2019t fooled by the name \u201CGreener
        Pastures\u201D, that was a pretty transparent marketing ploy to attract visitors
        after the mine closed down. We\u2019re not exactly known for our abundant
        flora here."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Shootin the shit with Yally (demo)
      type: 0
      typeString: 
