  - id: 21
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoFinmi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: Buy an old veteran a drink?|Know any good shanties, human? Oshunian
        naval tradition is pretty strong, we used to sing all the time.|In war, your
        unit is your family. When they put me in charge of one, I had 22 under my
        command and I got them all home. All of them. I was their big sister.|We're
        a race of warriors and we're proud of it. Or we used to be anyway...|A lot
        of people I served with turned to security work after the war, you see...
        Even piracy in some cases.
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Finmi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 22
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoStefan
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019ve tried some of Kmi\u2019s other drinks. Beer, wine\u2026 they
        messed up my insides. And not in a good way.|If I pay you $\u237E5, will
        you do a shot of a Myorjiin energy drink? It won\u2019t cover your medical
        bills after, but it\u2019ll be fun.|We Myorjiin don\u2019t get drunk, but
        if we have enough energy drinks, the little power surges we get are quite
        a buzz."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Stefan lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 23
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoAzoKmoni
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "zzzzZZZzzzzzZZZzzz|Huh? What time is it?|Kmi won\u2019t let me back
        in the bar until I sober up."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Azo-Kmoni lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 24
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoDeborah
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Are you jealous of my outfit? You should be.|If you\u2019re wearing
        sweatpants, don\u2019t even talk to me.|You might want to ease it on the
        garlic\u2026 I can smell you from a mile away."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Deborah lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 25
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoCindy
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "You know, I\u2019ve never been to Earth. I want to go one day and connect
        with my roots.|They say if you close your eyes and try to see through your
        eyelids, you see your true self.|Have you tried walking barefoot for a whole
        day? It really grounds you\u2026 but Kmi won\u2019t let you in here with
        no shoes on."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Cindy lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 26
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoLybll
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Be honest, do you think I look cool?|I blew a whole month\u2019s salary
        on this jacket. But it was totally worth it, right?|Can you tell this isn\u2019t
        my shell\u2019s natural colour? I dyed it to match the look I\u2019m going
        for."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Lybll lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 27
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoGllylo
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "This place isn\u2019t what it used to be\u2026 what a shame.|You look
        unhappy. I\u2019ll let you in on a secret: it doesn\u2019t get better.|Is
        it too much to ask for a little peace and quiet at the end of a long day?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Gllylo lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 28
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoLazarus
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Bootsie. That\u2019s your new nickname. It\u2019ll be a hit.|Wanna
        try your hand at blackjack? I bet you\u2019ll win!|You look lucky\u2026 stay
        away! Nah, I\u2019m just joshing. Wanna dabble in some gambling?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Lazarus lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 29
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJunichi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Life\u2019s a trip, my friend. We\u2019re lucky to be on it.|How often
        do you just slow down to take in the sights, sounds and smells around you?
        Think about that.|The feeling of socks slipping onto your naked feet\u2026
        is there anything better?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Junichi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 30
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoVeronica
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: I knew a woman who owned a taser. Man, was she stunning!|I meant to
        look for my missing watch, but I could never find the time.|Inspecting mirrors
        is a job I could really see myself doing.|Writing with a dull pencil is pointless.|I
        used to have a fear of hurdles, but I got over it.
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Veronica lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 31
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoFziHoxuni
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Question: are you currently dreaming? How do you know?|Question: if
        we had no sorrow or pain, would we still be able to enjoy life and love?|Question:
        do each of us have our own internal experience of love and anger and sadness
        that is different than everyone else\u2019s? Can we even know?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Fzi-Hoxuni lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 32
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoHammi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Why does watching sports have such a big impact on my emotions? My
        whole day is ruined now.|I know I\u2019m supposed to be a grown up at my
        age, but I\u2019m not sure I\u2019m doing it right.|Can I tell you a secret?
        I\u2019ve broken more than one video game controller in a fit of rage. I
        can\u2019t stand losing."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Hammi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 33
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoLomni
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019m the king of my planet and my kids behind me are princes and
        princesses. Will you fund our trip back home? I promise to make you a member
        of nobility when I get there.|Pardon me, I\u2019m a prince who was exiled
        from my planet. If you provide me with the funds to go back home, I will
        wire you a small fortune when I get there.|Ever met royalty? Now you have.
        I\u2019m a prince on my planet. This VIP royal chat package will be $\u237E250
        please."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Lomni lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 34
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoHanni
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I know I\u2019m a little guy, but did you know I\u2019m real good at
        eating?|How much does a rocket cost?|Can I bite your belly?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Hanni lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 35
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoSabni
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Do you know what happens if\u2026 if\u2026 I forgot.|Hey! Did you know
        that\u2026 I don\u2019t know what I was going to say.|Yesterday, I was talking
        to my brother and-- oh look, a shooting star!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Sabni'lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 36
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoFibnee
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Being a big sister is hard work, you know? But I can handle the responsibility.|I
        don\u2019t always know what my daddy is talking about. Do you?|Who would
        win in a fight: you or my dad?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Fibnee lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 37
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoXpuFawaz
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "zzzZZZzzZZzzzz|It\u2019s so sleepy in here.|Is this real life?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Xpu-Fawaz lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 38
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoOsee
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Good thing I have my library card\u2026 because I\u2019m totally checking
        you out.|Your hand looks heavy\u2026 can I hold it for you?|I hope you know
        CPR\u2026 because you are taking my breath away!|If you were a vegetable,
        you\u2019d be a *cute*cumber.|I couldn\u2019t help noticing that you look
        a lot like my next lover."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Osee lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 39
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoManfred
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019m a frequent flier myself, but I can\u2019t shake the pre-flight
        scaries, you know?|Gosh, I hope my ship doesn\u2019t malfunction and explode
        on takeoff!|They say all Myorjiin are purely logical, but that\u2019s just
        a stereotype\u2026 we still sweat the small stuff."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Manfred lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 40
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoBilliam
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Hey! Subscribe to my paid newsletter and you\u2019ll get so many tips
        on making mad money, you won\u2019t know where to start!|Join my emerald
        subscriber tier, and although you\u2019ll be giving me money, it\u2019s really
        an investment in yourself.|I was going to do a podcast teaching people how
        to get rich, but my tips are so powerful that giving them away for free could
        break the market."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Billiam lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 41
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoArona
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Don\u2019t look now, but I think these three kids next to me are actually
        spies.|They say this was an old mining facility. I don\u2019t believe it
        for a second. The \u201Cmine\u201D is actually where they\u2019re stockpiling
        the microchips they want to inject into us.|I\u2019ve been eating a teaspoon
        of that pink mold every day. Etheric plasmodiophoromycota is a proven immune
        system booster."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Arona lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 42
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoGakee
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: AAAHH! You scared me!|Why do you creep up on people like that?|I wish
        this corner of the galaxy got more sunlight. Darkness is spooky.
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Gakee lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 43
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJobll
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: This young human refuses to answer me. How very rude!|The Vesta lady
        who runs the bar refused to make me a custom cocktail. Well, I never!|That
        Myorjiin in the diner is such a good boy, but his food is simply unpalatable.
        What a shame.
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Jobll lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 44
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoFernanda
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Oi, tudo bem? Voc\xEA fala portugu\xEAs? Me ajuda? Juro que n\xE3o
        sei como vim parar aqui.|N\xE3o entendo nada que essa tia t\xE1 falando.|I
        sorry. I don\u2019t speaking English."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Fernanda lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 45
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoAdam
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "That\u2019s a great look you\u2019ve put together. I love it!|If you
        ever need another human to chat with, I\u2019m your guy!|Have you been at
        the station long? It\u2019s a cool place, huh?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Adam lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 46
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoAluKrado
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "It\u2019s curious how quickly we get used to convenient developments
        and take them for granted. It was merely 70 years ago that we began to travel
        through wormholes.|You should really learn more about the origins of the
        Myorjiin and their history with the Helicids and Toapi\u2026 it\u2019s fascinating
        stuff.|I\u2019m currently writing a book on the great war between the Oshunians
        of Tiamati and the Vesta. It\u2019s a tricky thing, writing history before
        the dust has properly settled."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Alu-Krado lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 47
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJancy
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "No. Don\u2019t even.|Listen, we\u2019re not friends. We don\u2019t
        even know each other.|I\u2019d rather not do the whole socializing thing,
        okay?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Jancy lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 48
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoXL%#&DH
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: '#&^//!%|}}*&)?(|%#][*.|!^(&&('
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando XL%#&DH lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 49
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKjiMakel
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Time! Time does not exist.|Eggs! This has been about eggs all along.|Of
        course! It is in this world, but not of it.|Parasites! We didn\u2019t know
        it, but they were parasites."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kji-Makel lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 50
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoWajl
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Flying never gets easier. The moment the ship takes off and we\u2019re
        just out there in the big dark nothingness of space-- No, I won\u2019t think
        about it.|I know I\u2019m statistically more likely to die from a sneezing-related
        accident than a shipping one\u2026 but sneezing is just inherently less scary,
        isn\u2019t it?|I don\u2019t see my flight on this board. Did it take off
        without me? Am I here on the wrong day? Oh no, not again!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Wajl lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 51
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoHarryJohn
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Welcome to Greener Pastures. We hope you enjoy your stay.|Keep an eye
        on the departures board to make sure you don\u2019t miss your flight.|Do
        not fall for anyone claiming to be a prince. Apart from Earth, monarchies
        have not been a part of any civilized society for at least 500 years.|Just
        a friendly reminder to never leave your luggage unattended."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Harry-John lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 52
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoTimothyEwan
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: If someone offers you money to take something off-station for them,
        be careful. It might be illegal.|If you run a business on the station, it
        is important to conduct background checks on all new employees. This is for
        your own safety.|Remember that Greener Pastures is a small place, and you
        will likely run into people again and again. So be pleasant and avoid conflict.|If
        you encounter any unexpected situations, use your best judgment when deciding
        whether to report them or not.
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Timothy-Ewan lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 53
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoGlorl
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Oh, hi. Is there a reason you\u2019re in the staff locker room?|I called
        my boss \u2018mom\u2019 by mistake. I don\u2019t think I can go back out
        there.|There\u2019s a human lady usually hanging out in Kmi\u2019s bar. I
        always hide from her. She looks mean."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Glorl lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 54
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoRxoDaprak
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Looks like there\u2019s room for at least a couple more hats in your
        closet.|I\u2019ve got hats for all types of customers! What\u2019s your top
        priority: style or health?|Only I\u2019m allowed to sit here, sorry. But
        if you buy a hat, I might let you squat for a couple minutes."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Rxo-Daprak lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 55
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJiajl
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Don\u2019t they smell nice? It\u2019s a wonder I don\u2019t eat them
        all myself.|I know they don\u2019t look it, but would you believe these are
        super good for you?|Ever try Helicid pastries? Get one before they\u2019re
        sold out!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Jiajl lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 56
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKzxPatanek
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Whatever they\u2019re selling next door, I bet mine are tastier.|I\u2019m
        all out at the moment, but come back later and I\u2019ll have a fresh batch
        out.|Vesta hors d\u2019oeuvres are hard, but lucky for you, I\u2019m darn
        good at it."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kzx-Patanek lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 57
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKikee
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I can\u2019t chat right now, I have to focus on playing.|Tips are appreciated!|Please
        ignore any wrong notes."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kikee lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 58
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoBlijil
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: (tootle tootle toot)|(doodle doodle det)|(deedle deedle dee)
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Blijil lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 59
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoSwaKfiki
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Where do I know you from? Why are you so familiar?|Sorry if I was staring.
        I can\u2019t remember where we met.|I can\u2019t shake the feeling that we\u2019re
        intimate friends. Are you sure we\u2019re not?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Swa-Kfikilines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 60
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoObee
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I don\u2019t think you have to wait to be seated. Just order at the
        counter.|Have you tasted Barry\u2019s Tiamatian plankton broth? It tastes
        like home!|I\u2019ve tried some Earth dishes here\u2026 gotta say, Earth
        cuisine is not for me.|Oof, I ate too much. I need to lie down now."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Obee lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 61
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoSlickback
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Barry\u2019s real people, dawg. Best dude on this station. Hands down.|Consuming
        organic matter is entirely unnecessary for Myorjiin, but it feeds the soul,
        you know?|I sometimes worry that ingesting organic matter isn\u2019t entirely
        without its risks, but I\u2019ve gotta support my main man, Barry!|With a
        designation like BAR-8362, you\u2019d think he\u2019d run a *bar*\u2026 but
        naw, my guy went for a diner. Classic Barry!|Don\u2019t tell Barry I told
        you, but one time, he had one too many energy drinks and went around introducing
        himself as Lord Barold VIII."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Slickback lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 62
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoBimi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019m getting a tattoo of an abacus\u2026 so you know you can always
        count on me.|I was feeling lonely so I bought some shares\u2026 it\u2019s
        nice to have a bit of company.|Yesterday a teenager told me \u201Cugh, I
        can\u2019t even\u201D\u2026 that\u2019s odd.|Did you hear they\u2019re installing
        a 2-inch tall windmill on the station? Not a big fan.|Want to hear a joke
        about time travel? Never mind, you didn\u2019t like it."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Blimi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 63
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoBxiTakol
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Uh\u2026 hi?|Sorry, I\u2019m not a good talker.|I don\u2019t know what
        to say\u2026 I\u2019m not good in social situations."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Bxi-Takol lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 64
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJulul
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "You\u2019ll meet plenty of people on this station, but I\u2019ll bet
        no Helicid will pick a fight with you. We\u2019re much too peaceful for that.|I
        can\u2019t get my head around people waiting to find a partner to then have
        children. Why not have kids first?|I\u2019m planning on starting a business
        real soon. I have so many ideas, it\u2019s hard to pick which one to go with."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Julul lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 65
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJligli
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Are you just gonna stand there while we eat? That\u2019s not uncomfortable
        at all.|If you\u2019re going to place an order, go for something simple.
        Less chance of Barry messing it up that way.|If I were you, I\u2019d just
        grab a single seat somewhere and stop lurking over the diner\u2019s patrons.|No,
        I won\u2019t give you a bite of mine. Order for yourself."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Jligli lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 66
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoBleem
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "McKenna has really helped me get in the right frame of my mind for
        my fitness journey.|Oshunian fighting yoga is just as much about the mind
        as it is about the body. Remember that.|Namaste, traveler. Are you also here
        to better yourself?|I used to struggle to move around the station. It wasn\u2019t
        just being unfit\u2026 I didn\u2019t have the motivation. Oshunian fighting
        yoga made me a whole new person.|Nothing like a nutritious and detoxifying
        juice after a power sesh."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Bleem lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 67
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKimee
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019m not very good at Oshunian fighting yoga yet. But I\u2019m
        trying my hardest.|I hope to one day be as peaceful and lethal as McKenna.|(pant,
        pant)|\u2026eighty-nine, ninety, ninety-one\u2026|Oshunian fighting yoga
        is teaching me to avoid conflict and also to end it if I have no choice."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kimee lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 68
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoChibi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Coffee, coffee, coffee\u2026 if I don\u2019t get some quick, we\u2019re
        gonna have a problem.|I\u2019m just here trying to make enough money so my
        parents can retire in peace. If you\u2019re looking for a new pilot, look
        no further. I got it.|Someone really needs to open up a new eatery on this
        station. I don\u2019t know how many more times I can eat at Barry\u2019s
        diner."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Chibi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 69
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoRhonda
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I can\u2019t get this damn thing to work!|All I want is a snack\u2026
        that\u2019s not a lot to ask, is it?|Why have a vending machine if it doesn\u2019t
        work? This is torture!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Rhonda lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 70
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoLauren
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "No offense, but we could never be friends.|Could we not do this right
        now? I\u2019m too tired to fake interest.|I need to leave. This place is
        a dump."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Lauren lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 71
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoRay
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Hey, can I tell you something? 01100010 01101111 01101111 \u2026 nah,
        I\u2019m just messing with you.|We should hang out some time! I bet we\u2019d
        get along.|If you\u2019re new here, I\u2019d be happy to introduce you to
        all my favorite guys, gals and nonbinary pals!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Ray lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 72
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoOkoHazofa
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "There\u2019s something oddly satisfying about deep conversations with
        shallow people.|From my interactions so far, I get the impression that humans
        love confidently talking about things they don\u2019t fully understand. Does
        that sound accurate to you?|Sticking with a crude understanding of time as
        simply linear is such an impediment to the generation of good ideas, wouldn\u2019t
        you say?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Oko-Hazofa lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 73
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoGenesio
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Wanna hear something that changed my life? You can\u2019t control a
        lot of things, but you can always control how you respond. |You want a deep
        thought? Nothing lasts forever, and that\u2019s a good thing.|It took me
        a long time to learn that some people and situations are just harmful, and
        there\u2019s strength in walking away."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Genesio lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 74
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKoomi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "There\u2019s nothing Oshunians hate more than being infantilized or
        being called cute. We can and will kick your ass if we need to.|You won\u2019t
        find many sweetwater Oshunians around these dodgy parts, but I\u2019m sure
        you\u2019ll find we\u2019re better conversationalists.|I miss the water.
        I miss sailing. I miss tending to moss fields. But I guess this is where
        I am now, so no point being miserable."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Koomi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 75
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKfiKafami
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: You look disconnected from life. It might help to caress the ground
        with the soles of your feet with every step you take.|Are you anxious? Remember
        that thoughts and feelings come and go, so sit back and allow them to.|Every
        breath we take is an opportunity to check in with ourselves and notice how
        we are feeling.
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kfi-Kafami lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 76
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoXqoTakol
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Do you want to come to my solo show all about my life? It\u2019s currently
        four hours long, but I\u2019m trying to get it down to three and a half.|Oh,
        this interaction would be great for the script I\u2019m writing. Do you mind
        if I put it in? I can\u2019t give you credit, though.|I might write a character
        based on your for my next play. I\u2019ll let you know when I\u2019m casting
        in case you want to audition."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Xqo-Takol lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 77
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoFtuAsakk
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Do you believe these wormholes are really connecting different parts
        of the galaxy? What if they\u2019re not and it\u2019s all fake?|Do you think
        Yally actually runs the station or are they just a puppet for a shady organization
        trying to control us?|I heard the water at the station has chemicals in it
        that will make you grow a tail. But I already have one, so I don\u2019t know
        if it\u2019s true."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Ftu-Asakk lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 78
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoIkaNatimi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Hi, you\u2019re welcome to join us if you like. We\u2019re just chatting.|I
        met this old king trying to get home. I only had $\u237E5 to give him. But
        he said when he gets back he\u2019ll send me a huge reward. How much do you
        think it\u2019ll be?|How much of what they teach in schools do you think
        is true?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Ika-Natimi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 79
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoBziKamoto
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Word of advice? Don\u2019t get on an Oshunian\u2019s bad side. They
        always fight things out and it won\u2019t end well for you.|You may find
        friendship and romance at Greener Pastures. Loyalty is a valued trait, so
        please be conscious of how you choose to behave.|I\u2019ve had many successes
        on this station, just not with the ladies. I just can\u2019t seem to connect
        with anyone here."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Bzi-Kamoto lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 80
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoPaul
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "A word of advice? Don\u2019t be self-conscious about dancing. No one
        cares if you\u2019re good, but they\u2019ll respect your commitment to it.|Of
        all the things I could have been at birth, why did I have to be human?|Why
        do we even do jobs? What\u2019s the point?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Paul lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 81
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoVraKtoono
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "If your life were to end tomorrow, would you be happy with how you
        spent your time?|Have you ever questioned your personal definition of success?
        Is income a factor in it?|If you think you\u2019re too busy to meditate,
        that\u2019s a sign you *really* need to meditate."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Vra-Ktoono lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 82
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoHmiSatak
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Yo, you like board games? I bet you do.|You ever read Vesta comic books?
        They\u2019re wild.|We all say we don\u2019t\u2026 but when no one\u2019s
        looking, we all pick our noses and bite our toenails, right?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Hmi-Satak lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 83
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoNkiAido
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Heeeeeeey, turn that frown upside down. Life is beautiful!|I don\u2019t
        remember falling asleep last night, but boy oh boy, did I wake up energized.
        It\u2019s a beautiful day!|You were in my dream last night! Or maybe I just
        saw you yesterday. That\u2019s less exciting."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Nki-Aido lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 84
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoFhoQwani
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Is it true that it\u2019s impossible to stop thinking?|Can I tell you
        a secret? I don\u2019t have any right now\u2026 but if I have one, I\u2019ll
        tell you later.|I\u2019ve been meaning to tell you something\u2026 but I
        can\u2019t remember what. Isn\u2019t that weird?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Fho-Qwani lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 85
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKfoOasi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Do grownups fart?|I bet my shoes are faster than yours.|When I grow
        up, I\u2019m going to build ships. And buildings. And chairs."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kfo-Oasi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 86
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKsaOasi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Do I know you? Are we best friends?|Have you met my little brother?
        He\u2019s the best!|Look at my mom! She never stops walking!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Ksa-Oasi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 87
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoGammi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Do you want to hear me sing? Lalala!|Mom? No, you\u2019re not my mommy\u2026
        right?|Do you know how to play?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Gammi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 88
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoZmiOasi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019m sorry I just want to be alone with my thoughts, right now.
        Is that okay?|This is a public space, so please be polite and respectful
        at all times.|These minutes I have to myself while my kids play are just
        bliss."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Zmi-Oasi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 89
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJniKronz
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "We\u2019ve met, haven\u2019t we? I swear I know you from somewhere.|Isn\u2019t
        socializing embarrassing?|I apologize if I\u2019m blushing."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Jni-Kronz lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 90
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoJmiGtakz
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Most important and underrated life skill? Cooking. Now go learn a new
        recipe.|Do you like money? Do you want more of it? Follow me and you can\u2019t
        go wrong!|Boy oh boy, do I have a business proposal for you\u2026 you just
        need to trust me with all your money."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Jmi-Gtakz lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 91
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoTseDziks
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "The Helicid in charge of this station\u2026 I can\u2019t tell if they\u2019re
        kind and polite or mean and rude. Let me know if you find out.|Although not
        a muscle, the mind benefits from constant exercise and grows from it. Don\u2019t
        forget that.|Have you ever judged a tree for being crooked or ugly? Then
        why do we do that to other people?"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Tse-Dzikis lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 92
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKliMazaku
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Did you know it\u2019s impossible to hum while holding your nose? That\u2019s
        a human fact I learnt.|While Vesta can all lick their elbows and chins, most
        humans can\u2019t. Don\u2019t believe me? Try it for yourself.|You\u2019d
        never guess it by looking at Helicids and hearing them speak, but they actually
        have tons of teeth\u2026 and they\u2019re sharp, too!"
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kli-Mazaku lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 93
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoZjiMazaku
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Next month I\u2019ll finally be old enough to go to Kmi\u2019s bar.
        My fake ID never works there\u2026 she\u2019s too smart for that.|Remember
        denim back from Earth? If I wore a jean jacket, do you think people would
        find it cool? Or would they laugh at me?|My little brother is such a weirdo
        in the best way possible. And I mean that as a compliment."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Zji-Mazaku lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 94
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoLmiMotror
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I\u2019m not prejudiced, but I\u2019ve never met a human I liked. Are
        there any good ones, I wonder.|They say science will one day let us live
        forever\u2026 what a nightmare.|Hate to break it to you, kid\u2026 but the
        name Greener Pastures isn\u2019t exactly accurate. Look at this place\u2026
        it\u2019s a disaster."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Lmi-Motror lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 95
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoTrvOror
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Remember this face. One day I\u2019ll be a big star. I can give you
        an autograph, if you like.|Once I\u2019m famous and touring all the planets,
        I\u2019ll hire Starlight Express to ship me around.|Arm wrestle, leg wrestle,
        mind wrestle\u2026 I don\u2019t care, I\u2019ll win at any of them. I dare
        you to challenge me."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Trv-Oror lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 96
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKorEyko
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Would you ever dare speak to others the way you speak to yourself?
        Maybe it\u2019s time you were kinder to yourself.|You know something? You\u2019re
        not everyone\u2019s cup of tea, and that\u2019s okay.|Don\u2019t be hard
        on yourself. We can do our best and still fail, and that\u2019s just fine."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kor-Eyko lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 97
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoRkaMatui
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Have you met my pet? Don\u2019t you just love him? He\u2019s the cutest!|I
        found this little guy on the ship on the way here. No one knew how he got
        onboard so I just adopted him. He\u2019s my little ray of sunshine.|If you\u2019re
        feeling lonely, may I suggest adopting a pet? It\u2019s done wonders for
        my mental health."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Rka-Matui lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 98
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoZekHmano
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "If you are ever lucky enough to witness the migration of the Yami,
        do not let the opportunity pass you by.|Few mysteries remain, but one of
        the most tangible and intriguing has to be those fellows you may see around
        in helmets. No one truly knows who they are or where they\u2019re from.|I\u2019ve
        seen many things in my lifetime, but I would love to visit Tpo-Anu-Oam one
        year for Maintenance Observation Day."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Zek-Hmano lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 99
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoKvoTaliz
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "I don\u2019t mean to brag, but Vesta are capable of a much richer mental
        landscape than humans.|Do you like dance? Back on Vesta Prime, I saw the
        most beautiful and intricate performance. It was a single movement perfectly
        executed by 900 people. It lasted 1.3 seconds.|Yes, we Vesta are known for
        our superior intellects, but we also take care of our bodies\u2026 I\u2019m
        trying to get some color here."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Kvo-Taliz lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 100
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoLgiDpkao
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "Stand back, you could get hurt with this laser mace\u2026 nah, just
        kidding, it\u2019s a vacuum cleaner.|If you\u2019re looking for Qza-Faroku
        and the council, they\u2019re next door. You need to go the long way around
        to get there.|Normally this room is so crowded, I kind of like the silence
        when everyone is out for the day."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Lgi-Dpkao lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
  - id: 101
    fields:
    - title: Name
      value: RandoDodi
      type: 0
      typeString: 
    - title: Initial Value
      value: "If anyone asks\u2026 I was never here, yeah?|Don\u2019t tell me your
        name. If I don\u2019t know who you are, I can\u2019t tell anyone anything
        about you. I appreciate this being a mutual understanding... you do understand,
        right?|Hey, you\u2019re not supposed to be around here at this time of night\u2026
        but I won\u2019t tell anyone if you don\u2019t."
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Description
      value: Rando Dodi lines
      type: 0
      typeString: 
